            "text": "<p>Pacific Essences® formulates pure Flower, Sea and Gem & Crystal Essences as non-invasive, gentle and effective tools for healing. </p><p>As the leading practitioners and pioneers of Energy Medicine®, we have over 40 years of experience learning, creating, and teaching about these powerful Essences from Mother Nature.</p>",
