            "caption": "",
            "heading": "<strong>Flower Essences</strong>",
            "text": "<p>The healing gifts of the flowers and trees of the Pacific Northwest are abundant and unique. Each of the 48 Flower Essences in our repertory contributes a unique vibration which can help us heal physically, emotionally, mentally and spiritually.</p><p></p>",
            "button_label": "SHOP | FLOWER ESSENCES",
