            "caption": "",
            "heading": "<strong>Gem & Crystal Essences</strong>",
            "text": "<p>Our Gem and Crystal Essences are lovingly prepared using the energy of both the Sun and the Moon in the Mother tincture. The geometry of gems and crystals demonstrates that their external symmetry is a reflection of their internal order. <br/><br/></p>",
            "button_label": "SHOP | GEM ESSENCES",
