        "row_39dNcm": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/4_774fb588-7bdf-45f9-9989-019a3574dbf2.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "<strong>Goddess Essences</strong>",
            "text": "<p>For both men and women, each Goddess Essence fosters the qualities of that goddess archetype and assists in dealing with challenges. They help women to embrace the energies of the goddess as she manifests in different aspects of their lives. They help men to recognize and feel their own goddess energy within.</p>",
            "button_label": "SHOP | GODDESS ESSENCES",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/goddess-essences"
          }
        },
        "row_bN97eC": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5_c5efd854-d735-44e6-8d9d-05a3fafd6f1e.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "<strong>Essence Combinations</strong>",
            "text": "<p>When a number of Essences are combined in a formula, the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. That’s why we call these Combinations 'synergistic formulas'. We have learned that when some Essences are combined, they can create an even bigger impact than when used individually.</p>",
