          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/6_89c9ee5b-4913-4d3f-ba12-09ef87f71e90.png",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "<strong>Essences for Animals</strong>",
            "text": "<p>Animals have a rich capacity for emotions. Our animal friends want to feel good and to be happy and content. Like us, chronic emotional and mental imbalances eventually affect their health, vitality and well-being. These Essence Combinations help to address common sources of dis-ease for pets and other animal friends.</p>",
